{
  "id": "1383",
  "title": "Takeout in the Office",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2023-04-16",
  "synopsis": "What do you eat for lunch at work?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1383/714d3ff8745079a27e622886df91b14a639aa1b0.mp3?1640271970",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "在办公室吃外卖\n\n白总：好了，今天的会就先到这儿，大家辛苦了。\n小高：白总，您中午想吃点儿什么？\n白总：你们平常吃什么？我和你们一起吃吧。\n小高：中午出去吃人太多了，我们一般叫外卖。就是有点儿简单，不知道您吃不吃得惯？\n白总：没问题，帮我也点一份吧。\n小高：好的，我现在在“美团”上下单，12点之前应该可以送到。",
    "traditional": "在辦公室吃外賣\n\n白總：好了，今天的會就先到這兒，大家辛苦了。\n小高：白總，您中午想吃點兒什麼？\n白總：你們平常吃什麼？我和你們一起吃吧。\n小高：中午出去吃人太多了，我們一般叫外賣。就是有點兒簡單，不知道您吃不吃得慣？\n白總：沒問題，幫我也點一份吧。\n小高：好的，我現在在“美團”上下單，12點之前應該可以送到。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Takeout in the Office"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "白总：好了，今天的会就先到这儿，大家辛苦了。",
      "traditional": "白總：好了，今天的會就先到這兒，大家辛苦了。",
      "pinyin": "bái zǒng hǎo le jīn tiān de huì jiù xiān dào zhè‘r dà jiā xīn kǔ le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "General Manager Bai: Okay, we’ll end today’s meeting here. Thank you everyone for your hard work."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小高：白总，您中午想吃点儿什么？",
      "traditional": "小高：白總，您中午想吃點兒什麼？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo gāo bái zǒng nín zhōng wǔ xiǎng chī diǎn'r shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Gao: General Manager Bai, what would you like to eat for lunch?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "白总：你们平常吃什么？我和你们一起吃吧。",
      "traditional": "白總：你們平常吃什麼？我和你們一起吃吧。",
      "pinyin": "bái zǒng nǐ men píng cháng chī shén me wǒ hé nǐ men yì qǐ chī ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "General Manager Bai: What do you all like to eat normally? I’ll eat with you all."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小高：中午出去吃人太多了，我们一般叫外卖。就是有点儿简单，",
      "traditional": "小高：中午出去吃人太多了，我們一般叫外賣。就是有點兒簡單，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo gāo zhōng wǔ chū qù chī rén tài duō le wǒ men yì bān jiào wài mài jiù shì yǒu diǎn'r jiǎn dān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "不知道您吃不吃得惯？",
      "traditional": "不知道您吃不吃得慣？",
      "pinyin": "bù zhī dào nín chī bù chī de guàn",
      "english": "Little Gao: If we go out to eat for lunch there are too many people. We normally order takeout, but it’s quite ordinary."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I’m not sure if you would be alright with eating that?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "白总：没问题，帮我也点一份吧。",
      "traditional": "白總：沒問題，幫我也點一份吧。",
      "pinyin": "bái zǒng méi wèn tí bāng wǒ yě diǎn yí fèn ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "General Manager Bai: No problem, please order some for me too."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "小高：好的，我现在在“美团”上下单，12点之前应该可以送到。",
      "traditional": "小高：好的，我現在在“美團”上下單，12點之前應該可以送到。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo gāo hǎo de wǒ xiàn zài zài měi tuán shang xià dān 2 diǎn zhī qián yīng gāi kě yǐ sòng dào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Gao: Okay, I’m ordering on “Meituan” right now. It should get here before 12:00."
    }
  ],
